. settings (NV EXPORT/IMPORT name.nvram), splash.png, usbdrive.png, system scripts
onBoot.s system script: end of start-up (NV sys.autorun 1)
onWait.s system script: FN before / instead / after around each Wait screen
onConnect.s system script: FN before / instead / after around the connect splash
default.nvram all NV settings at their defaults (NV IMPORT default)
debug.cfg log volume per device 0..4 (LOG DEBUG device n SAVE)
DESCRIPT.ION file descriptions for this folder
